  "description": "Subject: API Test Suite \u2013 Summary of Current Test Cases  \n\nThe first test, **GetUser**, is intended to retrieve user details by ID. Its description reads \u201cRetrieve user details by ID.\u201d The test is executed with the argument `userId = 123` and performs a **GET** request to `https://api.example.com/users/123`. The request includes the headers **Accept: application/json** and **Authorization: Bearer abcdef12345**, and a query parameter `verbose=true`. The expected response is a **200** status code, with a content type of **application/json**. The response must contain a **Content\u2011Type: application/json** header and a JSON body `{ \"id\": 123, \"name\": \"John\u00a0Doe\" }`. Additionally, the test captures the value of `$.authToken` from the response body for later use.  \n\nThe second test, **CreateOrder**, is described as \u201cCreate a new order with items.\u201d This test is currently marked to be ignored with the reason \u201cTemporary skip until payment service is stable.\u201d When run, it receives the argument `orderId = \"ORD-9876\"` and sends a **POST** request to `https://api.example.com/orders`. The request headers are **Accept: application/json**, **Content\u2011Type: application/json**, and **Authorization: Bearer xyz789**. Its JSON payload includes `customerId: 456` and an `items` array containing `{ \"productId\": \"P001\", \"quantity\": 2 }` and `{ \"productId\": \"P002\", \"quantity\": 1 }`. The expected outcome is a **201** status code, a content type of **application/json**, a **Location** header set to `/orders/ORD-9876`, and a response body `{ \"orderId\": \"ORD-9876\", \"status\": \"created\" }`.",
  "reference_json": [
    {
      "name": "GetUser",
      "description": "Retrieve user details by ID.",
      "calls": [
        {
          "args": {
            "userId": 123
          },
          "on": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.example.com/users/123",
            "headers": {
              "Accept": "application/json",
              "Authorization": "Bearer abcdef12345"
            },
            "params": {
              "verbose": "true"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "statusCode": 200,
            "contentType": "application/json",
            "headers": {
              "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "body": {
              "id": 123,
              "name": "John Doe"
            }
          },
          "remember": {
            "body": {
              "token": "$.authToken"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CreateOrder",
      "description": "Create a new order with items.",
      "ignore": "Temporary skip until payment service is stable",
      "calls": [
        {
          "args": {
            "orderId": "ORD-9876"
          },
          "on": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.example.com/orders",
            "headers": {
              "Accept": "application/json",
              "Content-Type": "application/json",
              "Authorization": "Bearer xyz789"
            },
            "body": {
              "customerId": 456,
              "items": [
                {
                  "productId": "P001",
                  "quantity": 2
                },
                {
                  "productId": "P002",
                  "quantity": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "statusCode": 201,
            "contentType": "application/json",
            "headers": {
              "Location": "/orders/ORD-9876"
            },
            "body": {
              "orderId": "ORD-9876",
              "status": "created"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
